Package: fasttrop
Title: Fast Triply Robust Panel Estimators for Panel Causal Inference
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Alex", "Farach", email = "farach@users.noreply.github.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Implements the Triply Robust Panel (TROP) estimator of Athey,
    Imbens, Qu, and Viviano (2026) <doi:10.1002/jae.70061> for average effects
    of binary treatments in panel data. The estimator combines unit weights,
    time weights, and a nuclear-norm regularized factor model on top of two-way
    fixed effects. It provides the paper's per-cell estimator and the block
    estimator of the authors' reference software, cross-validated tuning, and a
    unit bootstrap. The computational core is written in C with 'OpenMP'
    parallelism. This is an independent implementation and is not affiliated
    with the authors of the method.
